      "title": "图片",
      "items": [
        {
          "title": "红绿色盲",
          "content": "<p>红绿色盲的患者，看不到红色和绿色。在他们眼里，这两种颜色都会变成黄色。</p>\n<p>下面是一半红、一半绿的树叶。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202304/bg2023040802.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>红绿色盲患者看到的却是一张黄色树叶。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202304/bg2023040803.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>大概每20个人里面，就有一个人有色盲或色弱问题。所以，设计界面的时候，使用红色或绿色必须非常谨慎，因为红绿色盲患者分不清。</p>\n<p>下面的日历使用绿色和粉红色，表示特殊的日期。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202304/bg2023040804.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>但是，红绿色盲患者看到的是下面这样，根本分不清。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202304/bg2023040805.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>因此，用户界面轻易不要使用红色和绿色。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "红绿色盲",
              "url": "https://www.theverge.com/23650428/colorblindness-design-ui-accessibility-wordle"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202304/bg2023040802.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202304/bg2023040803.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202304/bg2023040804.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202304/bg2023040805.webp"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
